cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software if you use this formalization."
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
title: "A lower bound of 21 for 3 x 3 matrix multiplication over every field"
authors:
  - family-names: Ivanov
    given-names: Andrey
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-10-12
repository-code: "https://github.com/AIV5/mmrank21"
url: "https://github.com/AIV5/mmrank21/releases/tag/v0.1.1"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23324839"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 proof that every exact bilinear algorithm for multiplying two
  3 x 3 matrices over an arbitrary field uses at least 21 products of input linear forms.
  Includes a public statement in terms of arbitrary linear input forms,
  pinned dependencies, and reproducible build and axiom checks.
keywords:
  - matrix multiplication
  - tensor rank
  - bilinear complexity
  - Lean 4
  - formalized mathematics
